 by Gummy Smile, who controls the town, and is forced to pay compensation.\nHe decides to have his friend, Apple Ginger, repair the bike.\nFaced with this sudden, large expense, Brad ends up borrowing money from Gummy Smile.\nLet\u2019s work part-time at a warehouse to steadily save money and pay off the debt.", "summary": "Pay off your debts by working part-time in the nightlife district of Smile Town! Buy items from your friend Apple Ginger's shop to get an advantage at your part-time job.", "themes": [{"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/smile-town--1", "videos": [{"id": 193022, "name": "Game Intro", "video_id": "xX5RW30nUJc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xX5RW30nUJc", "title": "Smile Town // Game Intro", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/xX5RW30nUJc/sddefault.jpg"}]}